riencing issues with the Turkish government, as the Government of Turkey is planning to confiscate my assets. Therefore, I wish to invest my funds, totaling 85,000,000 euros, with you. \r\n \r\nFor further information, I would appreciate it if you could write to me with a brief biography about yourself as well. Please write to me directly at this email address, as I have this email application on my phone and can read emails quickly and give a prompt reply: *esaffet81@gmail.com ]   (mailto: esaffet81@gmail.com)*. \r\n \r\nMy regards, \r\n \r\nMr. Saffet Erdogan'),
