(251, 1, '2025-03-20 13:34:21', '2025-03-20 17:34:21', '<img width=\"277\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/logo_white-1.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n					<h2>Our Story, Our Passion</h2>				\n															<img width=\"610\" height=\"812\" src=\"https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/5.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/5.png 610w, https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/5-225x300.png 225w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 610px) 100vw, 610px\" />															\n					<h2>ABOUT US</h2>				\n		<p>At Bright Light Roofing, our mission is simple: your satisfaction. We strive to exceed your expectations, ensuring quality work that generates trust and recommendations. We look to the future with the vision of expanding our services and building a legacy of construction excellence.<br />The company is only one (1) year old, but our professionals have 15 years of experience in the industry; it is a family business. The motivation for creating Bright Light Roofing was customer satisfaction and the situation in Florida regarding the natural disasters that plague the population each year. The name comes from the light seen at the end of the tunnel, which symbolizes the hope of every human being.</p>		\n					<h2>OUR DIFFERENCE</h2>				\n		<ul><li aria-level=\"1\">Extended Warranty: We offer warranties from 8 to 10 years, surpassing the competition.</li></ul><ul><li aria-level=\"1\">Native Quality: We know Florida and its challenges, offering tailored solutions.</li><li aria-level=\"1\">Premium Materials: We use only the best materials to ensure the durability of your roof.</li></ul>		\n															<img width=\"610\" height=\"814\" src=\"https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/6.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/6.png 610w, https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/6-225x300.png 225w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 610px) 100vw, 610px\" />															\n					<figure><img width=\"160\" height=\"128\" src=\"https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/fa6-solid-people-roof.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>HONEST SERVICE</h3>				\n					<figure><img width=\"128\" height=\"128\" src=\"https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/lets-icons-check-fill.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>QUALITY SERVICE</h3>				\n					<figure><img width=\"128\" height=\"128\" src=\"https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/mingcute-love-fill.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>YOU ARE OUR PRIORITY</h3>				\n															<img width=\"997\" height=\"501\" src=\"https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/most-common-company-values-1-1.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/most-common-company-values-1-1.webp 997w, https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/most-common-company-values-1-1-300x151.webp 300w, https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/most-common-company-values-1-1-768x386.webp 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 997px) 100vw, 997px\" />															\n					<h2>What values ​​define Bright Light Roofing?</h2>				\n		<p>Trust, customer satisfaction, the customer is always right, seriousness when taking on any contract.</p>		\n					<h2>What makes us different from the rest?</h2>				\n		<p>We offer a warranty of 8 to 10 years (variable), we are originally from Florida. The value proposition we offer is to provide a service with the best quality in the materials that the rest of the competition works with.</p>		\n															<img width=\"1024\" height=\"761\" src=\"https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/3-1024x761.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/3-1024x761.png 1024w, https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/3-300x223.png 300w, https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/3-768x571.png 768w, https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/3.png 1085w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />															\n					<h2>Are you looking for an expert roofing professional?</h2>				\n					<a href=\"https://wa.link/o9ckxx\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M380.9 97.1C339 55.1 283.2 32 223.9 32c-122.4 0-222 99.6-222 222 0 39.1 10.2 77.3 29.6 111L0 480l117.7-30.9c32.4 17.7 68.9 27 106.1 27h.1c122.3 0 224.1-99.6 224.1-222 0-59.3-25.2-115-67.1-157zm-157 341.6c-33.2 0-65.7-8.9-94-25.7l-6.7-4-69.8 18.3L72 359.2l-4.4-7c-18.5-29.4-28.2-63.3-28.2-98.2 0-101.7 82.8-184.5 184.6-184.5 49.3 0 95.6 19.2 130.4 54.1 34.8 34.9 56.2 81.2 56.1 130.5 0 101.8-84.9 184.6-186.6 184.6zm101.2-138.2c-5.5-2.8-32.8-16.2-37.9-18-5.1-1.9-8.8-2.8-12.5 2.8-3.7 5.6-14.3 18-17.6 21.8-3.2 3.7-6.5 4.2-12 1.4-32.6-16.3-54-29.1-75.5-66-5.7-9.8 5.7-9.1 16.3-30.3 1.8-3.7.9-6.9-.5-9.7-1.4-2.8-12.5-30.1-17.1-41.2-4.5-10.8-9.1-9.3-12.5-9.5-3.2-.2-6.9-.2-10.6-.2-3.7 0-9.7 1.4-14.8 6.9-5.1 5.6-19.4 19-19.4 46.3 0 27.3 19.9 53.7 22.6 57.4 2.8 3.7 39.1 59.7 94.8 83.8 35.2 15.2 49 16.5 66.6 13.9 10.7-1.6 32.8-13.4 37.4-26.4 4.6-13 4.6-24.1 3.2-26.4-1.3-2.5-5-3.9-10.5-6.6z\"></path></svg>			\n									FREE QUOTE\n					</a>\n					<h2>BRIGHT LIGHT ROOFING</h2>				\n		<p>We look to the future, with the vision of expanding our services and building a legacy of excellence in construction</p>		\n							<ul>\n							<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M497.39 361.8l-112-48a24 24 0 0 0-28 6.9l-49.6 60.6A370.66 370.66 0 0 1 130.6 204.11l60.6-49.6a23.94 23.94 0 0 0 6.9-28l-48-112A24.16 24.16 0 0 0 122.6.61l-104 24A24 24 0 0 0 0 48c0 256.5 207.9 464 464 464a24 24 0 0 0 23.4-18.6l24-104a24.29 24.29 0 0 0-14.01-27.6z\"></path></svg>						\n										(