(285, 1, '2025-04-10 11:53:04', '2025-04-10 15:53:04', '<img width=\"277\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/logo_white-1.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n					<h2>SUPERIOR QUALITY</h2>				\n					<h2>Your Hope Under Any Roof in Florida</h2>				\n		<p>15 Years of Experience, Unsurpassed Quality, and the Light at the End of the Tunnel for Your Home or Business.</p><p> </p>		\n					<a href=\"#QUOTE\" target=\"_blank\">\n									GET A FREE QUOTE\n					</a>\n					<figure><img width=\"160\" height=\"128\" src=\"https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/fa6-solid-people-roof.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>HONEST SERVICE</h3>				\n					<figure><img width=\"128\" height=\"128\" src=\"https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/lets-icons-check-fill.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>QUALITY SERVICE</h3>				\n					<figure><img width=\"128\" height=\"128\" src=\"https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/mingcute-love-fill.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>YOU ARE OUR PRIORITY</h3>				\n															<img width=\"158\" height=\"203\" src=\"https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/yellow-border.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n															<img width=\"999\" height=\"493\" src=\"https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/rofing.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/rofing.png 999w, https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/rofing-300x148.png 300w, https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/rofing-768x379.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 999px) 100vw, 999px\" />															\n															<img width=\"178\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/dot-pattern.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n					<h3>SINCE 2010</h3>				\n					<h2>Protect Your Home Today! Request Your Free Quote</h2>				\n		<p>At Bright Light Roofing, we understand that a roof is more than just a structure; it\'s the protection of your dreams. With deep roots in the experience of Glen, our founder, and a years of dedicated service, we were born to provide reliable solutions in Florida. Inspired by the need for safe homes in the face of natural challenges, and with the name \'Bright Light\' symbolizing hope, we are here to illuminate your path.</p>		\n					<h2>QUALITY SERVICES</h2>				\n					<h2>SERVICES</h2>				\n									<h3>\n							Re-roof						\n					</h3>\n									<h3>\n							Shingle roof						\n					</h3>\n									<h3>\n							Tile roof						\n					</h3>\n									<h3>\n							Flat roof						\n					</h3>\n									<h3>\n							Tpo						\n					</h3>\n									<h3>\n							Comercial roofs						\n					</h3>\n									<h3>\n							Roof repair						\n					</h3>\n															<img width=\"997\" height=\"501\" src=\"https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/most-common-company-values-1-1.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/most-common-company-values-1-1.webp 997w, https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/most-common-company-values-1-1-300x151.webp 300w, https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/most-common-company-values-1-1-768x386.webp 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 997px) 100vw, 997px\" />															\n					<h2>What values ​​define Bright Light Roofing?</h2>				\n		<p>Trust, customer satisfaction, the customer is always right, seriousness when taking on any contract.</p>		\n					<h2>What makes us different from the rest?</h2>				\n		<p>We offer a warranty of 8 to 10 years (variable), we are originally from Florida. The value proposition we offer is to provide a service with the best quality in the materials that the rest of the competition works with.</p>		\n															<img width=\"596\" height=\"789\" src=\"https://www.brightlightroofing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Captura-de-panta